label Visit
label CollectionIntro
ReynaMayari: I am here to collect today's installment.
ReynaMayari: The quota for today is {Global.TodayQuota} pesos.
[signal arg="deduct_quota"]
ReynaMayari: Let's see what we have in the drawer... [pause=1.0]

if {Global.HasEnoughMoney} == 1.0:
	jump Success
else:
	jump Angry

label Success
ReynaMayari: I see you've been working hard. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: The installment has been collected. 
ReynaMayari: Keep this up, and your grandmother's debt will be a memory in no time. [pause=0.5]
ReynaMayari: Until tomorrow. [pause=0.3]
[end_timeline]

label Angry
ReynaMayari: [wave blue]I am disappointed.[/wave] [pause=0.5]
ReynaMayari: Your earnings for today are insufficient to cover your obligations.
ReynaMayari: Do not think my patience is infinite. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: Expect... [pause=0.3] complications if this happens again.
[end_timeline]
